  "summary": "Tecumseh was a Shawnee leader who worked to build an alliance of Native nations to defend their homelands. In the War of 1812 he fought alongside the British, and he was fatally wounded on 5 October 1813 in the battle at Moraviantown, near the Thames River in present-day Ontario.",
